{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/15e523eb469cdb781c479187e19cd381.avif?t=1758932268\" width=407 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.poster.avif?t=1758932268\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.webm?t=1758932268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/82c5354926e6072d345fdd23c5bbc8f0.avif?t=1758932268\" width=1539 height=927 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b1c\ufe0e About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the robots and spend a few in-game days with them in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session lasts about 10 minutes, but the more you replay,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the more you\u2019ll uncover their unique personalities and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immerse yourself in the world\u2019s atmosphere.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056330?t=1758932268","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056330?t=1758932268","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/9bc60afbe71c6d6b802e36da6e3f688c4ce415b1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758932268","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/9bc60afbe71c6d6b802e36da6e3f688c4ce415b1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758932268","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For everyone who wishes to be kind, and for those who can only live with kindness.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/15e523eb469cdb781c479187e19cd381.avif?t=1758932268\" width=407 height=199 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.poster.avif?t=1758932268\" width=1170 height=329 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/d75dc719fcc3ae4e6491e9f9e56274d3.webm?t=1758932268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Robot Hospice&quot;</strong> is a heartfelt adventure game about bidding farewell to beloved robots.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Welcome to Robot Hospice!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A place where cherished robots spend their final days\u2014the <strong>Robot Hospice</strong>.<br>As <strong>Midori</strong>, a new staff member, you will interact with these robots, share their memories, and face both partings and self-discovery along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/extras/82c5354926e6072d345fdd23c5bbc8f0.avif?t=1758932268\" width=1539 height=927 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0Your Role</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your goal in this game is to <strong>see all five robots through their final moments</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By talking to the robots and strengthening your bond with them,<br>you will learn about their past and their final wishes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>\ud83d\udda4 <strong>Your choices in conversations and actions will shape how you say goodbye.</strong></u><br>Do your best to give them the most peaceful farewell possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2b1c\ufe0e\u00a0A Nostalgic and Heartwarming World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story unfolds in a world depicted with <strong>charming 2D pixel art</strong> and accompanied by <strong>classic Famicom tunes</strong>.<br>Immerse yourself in an atmosphere filled with warmth and nostalgia.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u2b1c\ufe0e About the Demo</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the robots and spend a few in-game days with them in this demo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session lasts about 10 minutes, but the more you replay,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >the more you\u2019ll uncover their unique personalities and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >immerse yourself in the world\u2019s atmosphere.</p>","developers":["Buttercup garden"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3590010","name":"Robot Hospice"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056330/c94acea102da6a641c9d96b019498e399627f200/header.jpg?t=1758932268","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"This software was created using RPG Maker MZ.<br />\r\n\u00a9Gotcha Gotcha Games Inc./YOJI OJIMA 2020","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.13 (High Sierra) or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple M1 chip<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Display1280\u00d7768 resolution or higher</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4056330/224332247/b0192929e07fe7ea3ad4844015b20959da36